      "justification": "Traduction ES relue sur le texte EN complet ; commandes et ordre des buffers conserv\u00e9s. Reconstruction compl\u00e8te jusqu\u2019au FF depuis la ROM (inventaire tronqu\u00e9 \u00e0 512).",
      "en_inventaire": "Let me explain how the Pok\u00e9mon\\nWireless Club works.<0xFB>On this, the top floor, there are\\ntwo rooms.<0xFB>First, the room on the left.\\nIt's the Union Room.<0xFB>You may link up with Trainers\\naround you who have also entered<0xFA>the Union Room.<0xFB>With them, you may do things like\\nchat, battle, and trade.<0xFB>Second, the room on the right is\\nthe Direct Corner.<0xFB>You may trade or battle Pok\u00e9mon\\nwith your friends in this room.<0xFB>Sometimes, you may not be able to\\nfind your friends in the Union Room<0xFA>or the Direct Corner.<0xFB>In that case, pleas",
